        <mxCell id="eval_metrics" value="&lt;b&gt;评估指标&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AUC = 0.9874  |  F1 = 0.8666  |  AP = 0.5776&lt;br&gt;Recall = 0.8254  |  Precision = 0.8792&lt;br&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;9&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;5-fold CV, Nadeau-Bengio校正t检验&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E53935;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=SimSun;" vertex="1" parent="1">
